1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,420
Are you a racist party? Are you involved in a racist party?

2
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:09,040
No. We're not a racist country, Brian. We've never been a racist country.

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,720
Our goal is to make sure that today is better than yesterday.

4
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,020
Are we perfect? No.

5
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:18,520
But our goal is to always make sure we try and be more perfect every day that we can.

6
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:21,880
I know. I faced racism when I was growing up.

7
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:24,820
But I can tell you, today is a lot better than it was then.

8
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:27,100
Our goal is to lift up everybody.

9
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:31,700
Not go and divide people on race or gender or party or anything else.

10
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:33,200
We've had enough of that in America.

11
00:00:33,640 --> 00:00:35,640
That's why I'm so passionate about doing this.

12
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:41,120
I don't want my kids growing up where they're sitting there thinking that they're disadvantaged because of a color or gender.

13
00:00:41,540 --> 00:00:46,520
I want them to know that if they work hard, they can do and be anything they want to be in America.

